<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Who could change a soul like mine?</l><l>The life I lived—God was so distant;</l><l>He arranged the day and time—</l><l>Salvation came, and in an instant!</l><l>Touched my sight; His light came in;</l><l>Words of light shined on my sins!</l><l>What a change my God has done!</l><l>I’m one with Christ, the risen Son!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now I’m free—yes, free in Christ—</l><l>For all my chains my God has broken!</l><l>From that hold of sin and death,</l><l>My God has freed! For He has spoken:</l><l>“If the Son has set you free,</l><l>You are free, yes, free indeed!”</l><l>On the cross, Christ died for me</l><l>And bore my sins upon the tree!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now I rest from all my strife,</l><l>For all my works could never save me!</l><l>I depend on Christ my life,</l><l>My Strength, my Hope, my Rock, my Safety!</l><l>Not of works—’tis all by grace!</l><l>Rest in Him—my Dwelling Place!</l><l>What supply my Savior gives,</l><l>“Because He lives, I also live!”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Day by day, I now receive</l><l>Abundant grace, and without measure;</l><l>When I call His precious Name,</l><l>He fills my heart with streams of pleasure!</l><l>Call His Name and take God in!</l><l>Let Him fill you to the brim!</l><l>Let His Spirit fill your soul,</l><l>Till with His joy you overflow!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
